\title "3. Change notes"
\ts (4 4)
5.3.4{txt "Tab view. 1. Press this 5, then **Alt+Up arrow** twice.\nIt turns 7."}
  7.3.4 5.3.4 7.3.4 |
5.3.4 7.3.4{txt "2. Press this 7, then **6**.\nA half note."} 5.3.4 7.3.4 |
5.3.4{txt "3. **Ctrl/⌘+Z** undoes it."} 7.3.4 5.3.4 7.3.4 |
8.2.4{txt "4. Press this 8, then **Delete**.\nA rest."} 7.2.4 5.2.4 7.2.4 |
8.2.4
  7.2.4{txt "5. Press this 7, then **Ctrl/⌘+Down arrow**.\nFret 11 on the G string."}
  5.2.4 7.2.4 |

